# 统一换行策略：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台转换，避免 Windows 上反复出现
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告与无意义的整文件 diff。
* text=auto

# 源码与脚本：始终 LF 入库
*.py    text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.cfg   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
.gitignore   text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

# 批处理必须在 Windows 上以 CRLF 运行
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行/差异处理
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.dxf   -text
